{"repositoryId":1100623545,"availability":"available","full":"termide/termide","name":"termide","description":"All-in-one terminal workspace for desktops and servers: editor with LSP, file manager with SFTP/FTP, terminal, git, database viewer and a coding agent in one zero-config static Rust binary.","category":"Productivity","language":"Rust","stars":176,"forks":10,"created":"2025-11-20T14:30:41Z","updated":"2026-10-15T14:27:19Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://termide.github.io","topics":["cli","coding-agent","devops","file-manager","git","hex-editor","homelab","ide","llm","markdown","mcp","ratatui","rust","sftp","sql-client","ssh","sysadmin","terminal","text-editor","tui"],"demo":"https://termide.github.io/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T18:04:00.246Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T18:04:00.246Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T18:04:00.246Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T18:04:00.246Z","stars":176,"forks":10}],"technologies":["Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An all-in-one terminal workspace for your workstation and your servers: code editor with LSP, dual-pane file manager with SFTP/FTP, terminal, git, database viewer and a coding agent — one zero-config static binary written in Rust.","Website | Documentation | Releases | Screenshots","Terminal editors cover the code; everything around it — files on remote hosts, databases, git, long-running shells, a coding agent — usually takes plugins or separate tools. TermIDE ships all of it in one binary that works out of the box on a laptop, a server, or a phone. It does not try to replace those tools; it covers the part you reach for every day, in one place:"],"features":["Editor - Syntax highlighting for 23 languages, LSP completion, hover, go to definition, references, rename and diagnostics; toggle comment, auto-indent, auto-close brackets; optional Vim mode","Outline and diagnostics - Structural navigation synced with the cursor (Alt+O) and an LSP diagnostics panel (Alt+I)","Search and replace - Live preview, match counter, regex","Docs next to the code - Rendered Markdown, HTML (a text-mode browser that saves pages as Markdown) and Mermaid diagrams drawn as text; Ctrl+E switches to the source","Hex editor - Hex/ASCII view with a byte cursor, selection and search; overwrite editing with a .bak backup"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/termide/termide/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"7dc23b00b1dfcff754f35bfa4c10c506659f48c1a2638e8088c8b039a4636e1b","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T18:04:00.389Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T18:04:00.389Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"An all-in-one terminal workspace for your workstation and your servers: code editor with LSP, dual-pane file manager with SFTP/FTP, terminal, git, database viewer and a coding agent — one zero-config static binary written in Rust.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/termide/termide/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"No telemetry, no account and no update checks.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/termide/termide/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"7dc23b00b1dfcff754f35bfa4c10c506659f48c1a2638e8088c8b039a4636e1b","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/termide/termide/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T18:04:00.390Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-15T14:27:19Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/termide/termide/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T18:04:00.391Z","hash":"7dc23b00b1dfcff754f35bfa4c10c506659f48c1a2638e8088c8b039a4636e1b","originalBytes":26869,"storedBytes":26869,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["termide","file","git","run","themes","terminal","agent","linux","windows","editor","bash","build","project","detached","install","manager","nix","one","macos","plugin","prompt","any","binary","code","static","system","x86","arm64","cargo","github","servers","tar","viewer","auto","commands","doc","d